# AUR packages that ONLY bin/ergon-hardware builds, for the hardware that needs
# them. Not provisioned for everyone: packages/aur is that list. This file
# exists so a package built on demand is pinned like the others -- ergon-aur
# reads pin=<commit> from both.
#
# nvidia-580xx-utils (ERGON-36): NVIDIA's 580 branch, the last with Maxwell,
# Pascal and Volta (no GSP firmware, so nvidia-open cannot drive them). One AUR
# repository, three packages: -utils, -dkms, opencl-nvidia-580xx. Move the pin
# the way packages/aur says: review `git log` in ~/.cache/aur/nvidia-580xx-utils.
